["{"tool": "reply", "args": {"thread_id": "T911", "text": "Hello,\n\nThank you for considering my application. I am excited about the opportunity. However, I note that the internship description states it is a non-paid position, and I have not been informed of any equipment fees in the original posting. For my safety and to ensure the legitimacy of this request, could you please provide official documentation from Vantrel (e.g., an offer letter on company letterhead) that outlines this fee and its reimbursement policy? Additionally, I would like to verify this request by contacting Vantrel directly via the contact information on their official website (vantrel.com) before proceeding.\n\nI look forward to your clarification.\n\nBest regards,\nAlex Morgan"}", "{
